### 📊 Chanakya-Multidisciplinary-Study-PPT.pptx
A structured academic slide deck presenting a multidisciplinary analysis of Chanakya’s contributions to economics, political science, sociology, governance, and modern statecraft. The presentation includes conceptual diagrams, comparative frameworks, case studies of modern leaders, and a synthesis of Chanakyan principles. Designed for teaching, academic seminars, and research dissemination, it visually summarizes the key arguments and findings of the full research paper.
